<title>USA: Sioux City hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderately active. Compared with Wednesday, barrows and gilts traded steady to $0.50 higher. Top $58.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     58.00-58.50</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     57.50-58.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     55.50-57.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     53.50-55.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up mostly $0.50. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs     44.50</p>
<p>		 400-450 lbs     45.50</p>
<p>		 450-500 lbs     47.00</p>
<p>		 500-550 lbs     48.00</p>
<p>		 550-700 lbs     49.00</p>
</text>
